{"t":"Elathriel","s":"elathriel-c50c0","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_9_ca2896.png","q":7,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Elathriel</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAb'Dendriel\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145942&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_9_ca2896.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32684,31671,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32684, 31671, 9)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Elf</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Officer<br/>Caste Leader</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.2<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 10, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230824231226&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elathriel_5bca98.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Elathriel.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>2 floors underground at the Prison on Shadow Caves Street\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Elathriel Shadowslayer is responsible for prisoners, and keeping guard over <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a>. Member of Kuridai caste. Sells some spells to Druids, some of which are available to Sorcerers but not via this NPC.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not buy anything.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203012\"><img alt=\"Copper Key\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Copper_Key_a0bf0e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203012\">Key 3012</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Elathriel.</i></dd></dl>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Elves\">Elves</span></h4>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>elves</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Elathriel</strong>: My people are divided in castes in these times, until they comprehend that only the way of the [Kuridai]] can save us all.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Cenath</b><br/>\nElathriel: Arrogant bastards, but they wield quite powerful magics.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Teshial</b><br/>\nElathriel: Dreamers are of no practical use. I don't mourn their demise.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Deraisim</b><br/>\nElathriel: Confused cowards. With all their skill they still tend to hide and run. What a waste.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Kuridai</b><br/>\nElathriel: We are the heart of the elven society. We forge, we build, and we don't allow our people to be pushed around.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Elathriel</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Other\">Other</span></h4>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Elathriel</strong>: Be greeted <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>army</b><br/>\nElathriel: It's one of the more useful concepts we can learn from the other races.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>door</b><br/>\nElathriel: For safety we keep the door to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">hellgate</a> locked all times. I have the keys to open it when needed.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">hellgate</a></b><br/>\nElathriel: It was here among other structures, like the depot tower, before our people came here. It's secured by a sealed door.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203012\">key</a></b><br/>\nElathriel: If you are that curious, do you want to buy a key for 5000 gold? Don't blame me if you get sucked in.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>no</b><br/>\nElathriel: Believe me, it's better for you that way.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b><br/>\nElathriel: It's hard for some of my people to grasp the true concept of a strong leader.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>magic</b><br/>\nElathriel: I mastered some spells of battle.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nElathriel: Not that I like to talk to you, but I am Elathriel Shadowslayer.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Tibianus</b> or <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Queen%20Eloise\">Eloise</a></b><br/>\nElathriel: A human weakling, not much more.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nElathriel: I couldn't care less.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>druids</b><br/>\nElathriel: Druids' magic is to peaceful for my taste.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>sorcerers</b><br/>\nElathriel: I have seen human sorcerers doing some impressive things ... before they died.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>dwarfs</b><br/>\nElathriel: We might use the shelter earth and hills provide us, but their obsession for metal is a waste of time.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>trolls</b><br/>\nElathriel: Like all inferior races they can be at least used for something good. The other castes are just jealous about our use of them.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Excalibug</b><br/>\nElathriel: I still doubt it exists.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras\">Ferumbras</a></b><br/>\nElathriel: Even if he'd walk through the town above the other castes won't see the necessity to follow OUR way.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nElathriel: Asha Thrazi, stranger.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Elathriel</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["draconia-quest","realm-of-dreams-quest","secret-service-quest","shadows-of-yalahar-quest","the-explorer-society-quest","the-lightbearer","the-roost-of-the-graveborn-quest"],"pos":{"x":32684,"y":31671,"z":9}}